{
  "description": "Universal Grammar syntax-tree builder — the learner assembles a sentence's constituent structure bottom-up, attaching one labelled bracket (NP, VP, PP, S) at a time in derivation order, with evidence text on every pick and a growing bracket-tree render on a math-canvas. Standalone by default; behind a lab router set matchMode and it renders only when MODE_SELECTED matches.",
