              "description": "Roster of sentences the learner parses. Each sentence carries its words (text + part-of-speech tag) and an ORDERED bottom-up derivation: each step names the constituent category built, the word-index span it covers, the tree level it renders at, and the evidence text shown when the learner attaches it (correctly or not).",
